    27	
    28	## Definition
    29	
    30	For $a>0$ and $x\in\mathbb R$, define
    31	$$a^x:=\exp(x\log a).$$
    32	For the supplementary zero-base convention, define $0^x:=0$ when $x>0$.
    33	
    34	The expressions $0^0$ and $0^x$ for $x<0$ are left undefined. Negative bases are not assigned arbitrary real powers.
