research/audit/wave3-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-6047-     "step": "3.1",
research/audit/wave3-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-6048-     "claim": "Claim 2: $a^{r+s} = \\big(a^{1/N}\\big)^{m+k} = \\big(a^{1/N}\\big)^{m}\\big(a^{1/N}\\big)^{k} = a^{r} a^{s}$, the middle equality being the integer addition law applied to the nonzero base $a^{1/N}$.",
