research/audit/wave3-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-6079-    {
research/audit/wave3-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json:6080:     "id": "lem-rational-power-laws::3.4",
research/audit/wave3-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-6081-     "step": "3.4",
research/audit/wave3-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-6082-     "claim": "The supplementary nonnegative case, product identity: let $a, b \\ge 0$ and let $r > 0$ be rational; if $a > 0$ and $b > 0$ this is step 2.2, and otherwise $a = 0$ or $b = 0$, so $ab = 0$ and the left side is $0^{r} = 0$, while the right side $a^{r}b^{r}$ has a factor $0^{r} = 0$ and is therefore $0$ as well.",
